   "text": "Stop 2: More than one"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "markdown": "A **plural** means more than one. We usually add **s**: one cat, two cats.\n\nIf a word ends in s, x, ch or sh, we add **es**: one box, two boxes."
  },
